# Cat facts from catfact.ninja and pictures from thecatapi.com.

### Random fact
GET {{cats}}/fact
Accept: application/json

> assert status == 200
> assert body.fact != null
> print body.fact

### Breeds
GET {{cats}}/breeds?limit={{limit}}
Accept: application/json

> assert status == 200
> assert body.data.length == limit
> print "first breed: " + body.data[0].breed

### Picture
GET https://api.thecatapi.com/v1/images/search

> assert status == 200
> set catPicture = body[0].url
> print catPicture
